.TH PKGREBUILD 1 "2026-09-07" "@PROJECT_NAME@" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
pkgrebuild \- rebuild the toolchain and base packages
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B pkgrebuild
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B pkgrebuild
rebuilds packages in dependency order. With no option it rebuilds both the toolchain and base packages. The operation installs rebuilt packages and requires root privileges.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B -t, --toolchain
Rebuild the toolchain only.
.TP
.B -b, --base
Rebuild the base set only.
.TP
.B -h, --help
Show help.
.SH EXIT STATUS
Zero on successful rebuild; non-zero on permission, build, or installation failure.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR pkgbuild (1),
.BR @PROJECT_NAME@ (1)
